<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="AIspanda privacy information for the initial public website.">
  <header class="page-hero shell"><p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p><h1>Collect less. Explain clearly.</h1><p class="lede">The public site works without advertising trackers. Private staff accounts use only the identity and operational data needed to secure Content Studio.</p></header>
  <div class="shell legal-copy">
    <h2>Website access</h2><p>The hosting platform may process technical request information needed to deliver and protect the site. AIspanda will document analytics separately before enabling them.</p>
    <h2>Staff sign-in</h2><p>Content Studio uses Google sign-in through Firebase Authentication. AIspanda receives the account identifier, verified email address, display name, profile image, sign-in provider and sign-in timestamps supplied for authentication. It also records the assigned role, draft authorship, privacy-notice version and necessary security and audit events. AIspanda does not request access to Gmail, contacts or other Google account content.</p>
    <h2>Analysis and outreach</h2><p>Operational activity may be used to run, secure and improve the service and to produce aggregated analysis. Signing in does not subscribe a person to promotional outreach. Any future outreach subscription will be a separate optional choice with clear preferences and an unsubscribe route. AIspanda will not infer or target religious, philosophical, political, health or other sensitive traits from reading, group or comment activity without a separately documented lawful basis and safeguards.</p>
    <h2>Email</h2><p>If you email AIspanda, your email provider and the receiving provider process the message. Do not send sensitive, confidential, financial, health or credential information through ordinary email.</p>
    <h2>Support form demo</h2><p>The support form demo sends the name, email address, optional organisation, subject and message you provide to a private operational database. The public Case queue combines three curated fictional Cases with safe metadata—Case number, channel, status and received time—for the three most recent live submissions. A fourth live submission replaces the oldest live Case and its unreferenced demo-created contact or organisation. Submitted names, addresses, subjects, messages and provider identifiers remain private. An email acknowledgement is sent through the dedicated demo mailbox. Use fictional, non-confidential information only.</p>
    <h2>Future capabilities</h2><p>Public comments, community accounts, newsletters and AI interactions are not active in this release. Their data, consent, moderation and retention rules will be published before activation.</p>
    <h2>Questions</h2><p>Contact <a href="mailto:rajeevkasatai@gmail.com">rajeevkasatai@gmail.com</a>.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
